notes.content:
Spacelanders! The long-awaited update will arrive very soon:

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34829109/725b693fc542751f2da5ba615e95a0e5653164f2.jpg


 A new co-op campaign mode will be unlocked. In this story mode you will learn about Jim's fascinating adventures from the moment he graduated the academy to the time he became an officer of the space rangers;
 6 new cooperative storyline battles to be played together with your friends;
 New playable characters with their own characteristics and temper will be added to the storyline. Harvey and Theo are ready to help Jim and Barrett unravel the case of a dangerous smugglers gang. Will they succeed or not - depends on you;
 New enemies are added, try to overcome them;
 With expanded Adventure Map you will learn more about the Star Federation and the world of Spaceland;
 The Main Boss has become even more insidious and engaging. Test your skill in battles against him;
 Now you have the ability of prompting an ally with arrow signs;
 Two additional daily missions were added. You can unlock them with gold;

This and even more is coming in this new update, don't miss it! 

Wishlist and follow our new DLC:
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1162220/Spaceland_Cooperative/

